          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö kui̱ci duɔ̱p in jäl kɛ jiɔam, kä kui̱c tuk gatda kɛ rɔ jic man, kä inɔ /ci lät Kuɔth in cak ti diaal dee ŋa̱c.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pi̱thni kɛ runwaŋ kä pi̱thni bäkɛ thiaŋ. Kɛ ɣöö kui̱ci tin bi do̱ny, dɔ̱ŋ bikɛ do̱ny agɔaa kɛn diaal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buay gɔaaɛ, lotdɛ rɔ ɛn ɣöö dee raan te rɛy buɔyä.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ci raan ni̱nkɛ ŋuan teekä, akɛ niinɛ kɛn diaal agɔaa. Kä timɛ bä ɛn ɣöö bi ni̱n li̱eth ŋuan bä. Kä kɛn diaal thilɛ kɛ luɔt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Luek kɛ kui̱ ŋuɛ̈tni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A lɔcdu tɛth ŋuɛɛtädu lö ŋuɛ̈t. Kä guuri ni min go̱o̱r lɔcdu jɛ kä guic waŋdu jɛ. Kä ŋäc ni jɛ ɛn ɣöö kä kɛn ti diaal ti̱ti̱ bi Kuoth ji̱ luk kɛ kɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "/Cu diɛɛr kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱r, kä /cu riɛk car kɛ lɔcdu. Kɛ ɣöö /ci bi dɔŋ kɛ ŋuɛɛt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
